                                                                               
 Usage: escape-the-valley-1.3.1-win-x64.exe [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...        
                                                                               
 Escape the Valley: Ledger Trail — Oregon Trail-style survival game            
                                                                               
┌─ Options ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ --version             -V        Show version and exit.                      │
│ --licenses                      Show third-party license notices and exit.  │
│ --install-completion            Install completion for the current shell.   │
│ --show-completion               Show completion for the current shell, to   │
│                                 copy it or customize the installation.      │
│ --help                          Show this message and exit.                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌─ Commands ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ new         Start a new run.                                                │
│ play        Continue a saved run.                                           │
│ status      Show current party, wagon, and supplies.                        │
│ journal     Show recent journal entries.                                    │
│ self-check  Check game environment health.                                  │
│ tui         Launch the full-screen Textual UI.                              │
│ version     Show version.                                                   │
│ licenses    Show license and third-party notices.                           │
│ stats       Show run statistics from the current save.                      │
│ postcard    Print the end-of-run postcard (trail ledger / XRPL receipts).   │
│ ledger      Ledger Backpack commands                                        │
│ parcel      Parcel commands                                                 │
│ wallet      Wallet commands                                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

